Thumbs.db

# Build output. Gitignored because a one-word copy change would otherwise
# produce a 20+ file diff that buries the one-line change in content/en.json —
# and unreadable diffs are exactly the failure an i18n build exists to prevent.
#
# Safe to ignore only because the build is deterministic and has zero npm
# dependencies: `git checkout <sha> && npm run build` reproduces any past
# deploy, with no lockfile and no registry in the way. deploy.sh also keeps a
# server-side rollback copy at $DOC.prev.
dist/
